WEBVTT

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.216
and translate into products
for everyday use.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:03.696
So, the water bottle.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.376
I'll begin with this concept
of what I call DNA.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.576
DNA: Design, Nature, Art.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.981
These are the three things
that condition my world.

00:02:11.005 --> 00:02:16.496
Here is a drawing by Leonardo da Vinci,
500 years ago, before photography.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:21.576
It shows how observation,
curiosity and instinct

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:24.816
work to create amazing art.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:27.616
Industrial design is the art form
of the 21st century.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.176
People like Leonardo --
there have not been many --